  "zh": "# ChatGPT跨站追踪引隐私争议，国产存储与AI基建双双突破\n## AI与科技\n- **ChatGPT追踪用户跨站行为**：通过广告收集器获取用户在其他网站的浏览数据，隐私边界再次被打破。\n- **Qwen Image 2.1发布**：图像生成能力持续迭代，国产多模态大模型竞争白热化。\n- **字节清华开源DAPO系统**：大模型训练基建再添利器，开源生态加速底层技术普惠。\n## 行业动向\n- **长鑫第五代技术平台量产**：国产存储芯片突破关键节点，有望缓解高端内存供应链压力。\n- **三星HBM4内存产量将翻倍**：巨头加码下一代高带宽存储，AI算力军备竞赛向硬件端蔓延。\n## 社会民生\n- **闲鱼暗藏涉黄产业链**：二手交易平台沦为违法温床，未成年人保护机制亟待平台落实。\n- **央视曝光挂靠参保乱象**：社保资金遭挂靠偷取，监管漏洞暴露出灵活就业体系的短板。\n## 国际视野\n- **中美经贸磋商在纽约举行**：双边高层接触重启，全球市场密切关注关税与贸易政策走向。",
  "en": "# ChatGPT cross-site tracking sparks privacy concerns; AI infra and domestic chips advance.\n## AI & Tech\n- **ChatGPT tracks cross-site activity**: Ad collectors feed your browsing data to the model, shattering privacy boundaries once again.\n- **Qwen Image 2.1 released**: Alibaba's image generation iterates rapidly, intensifying the multimodal model competition.\n- **ByteDance & Tsinghua open-source DAPO**: A new RL system empowers LLM training, accelerating open-source infrastructure accessibility.\n## Industry\n- **CXMT 5th-gen tech mass production**: Domestic storage chips hit a milestone, potentially easing high-end memory supply chain pressures.\n- **Samsung to double HBM4 output**: The giant bets big on next-gen high-bandwidth memory, pushing the AI hardware arms race forward.\n## Society\n- **Xianyu hides illegal adult content**: The secondhand marketplace becomes a breeding ground for crime, demanding better minor protection.\n- **CCTV exposes social security fraud**: Fake employment schemes drain funds, revealing loopholes in the flexible employment system.\n## Global\n- **US-China trade talks in NY**: High-level bilateral contact resumes, with global markets closely watching tariff policies."
